    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">20 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Binary search</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Matrix</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/search-a-2d-matrix/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 74</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Search a 2D Matrix</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Don't treat it as a matrix: rows are sorted and each row starts above the previous row's end, so read row by row it is one sorted array of m·n values. Binary search the flat index k and read <code>matrix[k / n][k % n]</code>. O(log(m·n)) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
  },
